formulas(assumptions).

    % If I am not playing, I am watching.
    -Playing -> Watching.

    % If I am not watching, I am reading.
    -Watching -> Reading.

    % I cannot do two tennis activities at the same time.
    -(Playing & Watching).
    -(Playing & Reading).
    -(Watching & Reading).

end_of_list.

formulas(goals).

    % I am watching tennis.
    Watching.

end_of_list.